ParentVault_completeEpochDeposit
├── when caller does not have EPOCH_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
├── when no epoch has completed
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoCompletedEpoch
├── when the expected epoch nonce does not match the most recently closed epoch nonce
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InvalidEpochNonce
├── when the previous epoch is not a net-deposit epoch
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotNetDeposit
├── when the previous net-deposit epoch is not executing
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotExecuting
├── when the actual deposit amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InvalidActualDepositAmount
├── when the actual deposit amount exceeds the expected net deposit
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InvalidActualDepositAmount
├── when reconciliation rounds the pending share allocation to zero
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__DepositWouldMintZeroShares
├── when the actual deposit equals the expected net deposit
│   └── it should preserve the epoch share allocation and total shares
├── when the actual deposit is less than the expected net deposit
│   ├── it should reduce the epoch share allocation
│   ├── it should reduce authoritative total shares by the same amount
│   ├── it should preserve gross deposit claim counters
│   └── it should round adjusted shares down
├── when the epoch contains deposits and withdrawal claims
│   └── it should reconcile deposit shares using withdrawals plus the actual remote deposit
├── it should emit EpochDepositReconciled before EpochClaimable
├── it should mark the previous epoch claimable
├── it should emit EpochClaimable
└── when the vault is paused
    └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
